<title>POLAND: BIG APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 3.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 3.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.84 vs    3.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.84 vs    3.95</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 13.86 vs   15.42</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	39.87 vs   43.37</p>
<p> OCTOBER-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 26.03 vs   35.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   26.03 vs   35.54</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 31.38 vs  141.71</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     231.23 vs  300.61</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
